    "id": "i-G7csptc",
    "title": "Lifted",
    "description": "Lifted is a painterly Western fine art photograph by Wayne Heim, capturing a moment of quiet resolve and spiritual grounding in the American West. Rendered in warm morning light, the image blends cinematic composition with a textured, painterly finish—evoking the visual language of classic Western art while remaining unmistakably contemporary.  Rather than action or spectacle, this piece centers on stillness as strength. The mounted figure, framed by rising terrain and open sky, embodies reflection, gratitude, and the resolve to continue forward. Lifted reflects Heim’s signature approach to Western fine art photography: narrative-driven, emotionally grounded, and rooted in mythic simplicity.  Available as a museum-quality fine art print, this work speaks to collectors drawn to Western storytelling, painterly photography, and images that linger long after the first glance. © Wayne Heim",
    "alt": "Painterly Western fine art photograph of a cowboy on horseback pausing in morning light, eyes closed in reflection against a rugged hillside and open sky.",
    "src": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-G7csptc/1/Nb7htkPs3R6QKt3KVVLmnG7w5ttnP8v9PTDKwXxbd/XL/_HF26959-Edit-Edit-XL.jpg",
    "srcXL": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-G7csptc/1/Nb7htkPs3R6QKt3KVVLmnG7w5ttnP8v9PTDKwXxbd/XL/_HF26959-Edit-Edit-XL.jpg",
    "srcL": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-G7csptc/1/Nb7htkPs3R6QKt3KVVLmnG7w5ttnP8v9PTDKwXxbd/XL/_HF26959-Edit-Edit-XL.jpg",
    "srcM": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-G7csptc/1/M5kpzVXcFVqfB3TC2Tr9S45Xs8NT6QhHPF3TMKJnt/L/_HF26959-Edit-Edit-L.jpg",
    "srcS": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-G7csptc/1/LSkd4KGVH79GLfDRQfWBBNNMDKcS3TZnKz4ZdHt4V/S/_HF26959-Edit-Edit-S.jpg",
    "srcOriginal": "",
    "buyLink": "https://wayne-heim.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-G7csptc/A",
    "keywords": "Painterly Western fine art photograph of a cowboy on horseback pausing in morning light, eyes closed in reflection against a rugged hillside and open sky.",
    "story": "Eyes closed, face lifted into the morning light — centering her thoughts. Giving thanks or asking for permission?... forgiveness?... or the strength to go another mile.\nThe entire image lifts the viewer skyward — the tree line, the sloping ridge, the sun itself — all pulling you out of the dust and into something larger, bigger then herself.\nAnd then there’s the horse. Looking straight through you.\nWitnessing. Almost as if it's saying: \"What are you waiting for? You can do this too.\"\nThere’s enough chaos in the world. This piece isn’t about adding more. It’s a pause. A reckoning. A reminder. Sometimes, stillness is the action.",
    "notes": "Lifted draws its power not from motion, but from restraint. The composition deliberately elevates the viewer’s eye—from horse to rider to sky—creating a vertical rhythm that mirrors the internal ascent of the subject. Light functions not merely as illumination, but as narrative force, softening the terrain while clarifying intent.\n\nThis piece sits comfortably within the lineage of Western iconography, yet departs from traditional heroism. Where earlier Western art emphasized action and conquest, Lifted reframes strength as awareness—closer in spirit to pictorialist quietude and modern cinematic pause than frontier bravado.\n\nThe painterly surface treatment enhances this timelessness, blurring the boundary between photograph and painting. For collectors, Lifted represents a mature, contemplative expression of the Western myth—one that values introspection as much as endurance.",
